Answer with three fields:
- reply_needed: false only when the conversation needs no reply from the agent right now.
- reply: the message for the customer, written once, exactly as it should be sent. Leave it empty when no reply is needed.
- note_for_agent: one short line for the agent. When no reply is needed, say why. Put any other remark for the agent here, never in the reply.
